.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Ai awoke in an alley with no memory of who she
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]was. As she wandered Tokyo trying to survive, she
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]discovered she could sense others' thoughts and
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]emotions, and even move objects with her mind.
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Worse, she found herself doggedly pursued by
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]strange, unsettling men in black suits.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Shy and withdrawn, Ai struggles to
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]connect with people and finds it hard to
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]put her feelings into words. She'd rather
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]avoid a problem than face it -- though her
.L 407.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]real trouble is that she has nowhere left to
.L 417.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]run.
.CP
.SH
\&Ai: Ability Notes
.PP
\&Barrier: provides an alternate Defense Roll (the second Defense value below)
.SH
\&Ai: Attacks
.PP
\&Telekinetic Push: Ai lashes out with her telekinetic powers, pushing the target away.
.PP
\&Mind Break: Ai fills another's mind with a confusing din of psychic energy, draining the opponent.
